[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9060.389, "timestamp": "02:31:00", "text": "我们已经封锁了该区域，但人质处于危险"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9061.67, "timestamp": "02:31:01", "text": "之中，我们不能发动进攻"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9063.51, "timestamp": "02:31:03", "text": "。 我们需要你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9065.75, "timestamp": "02:31:05", "text": "帮助。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9068.87, "timestamp": "02:31:08", "text": "他们说有 80 或 90 名操作员，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9074.71, "timestamp": "02:31:14", "text": "但我们只看到了四个班级。 或许。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9076.469, "timestamp": "02:31:16", "text": "嗯？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9079.429, "timestamp": "02:31:19", "text": "但是运营商那边是怎么回事？ 我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9085.67, "timestamp": "02:31:25", "text": "该死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9117.67, "timestamp": "02:31:57", "text": "嘿，为什么它让我想起了《彩虹六号："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9119.429, "timestamp": "02:31:59", "text": "围攻》"}]